  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study Centre of Excellence in Maritime Logistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will research the possibility for Dutch institutions to become involved (in cooperation with Indonesian stakeholders) in maritime logistics education in Indonesia and what is required for that. It will provide information in terms of market analysis, legal and legislative requirements, demand for education, human resources needed, cost-benefit analysis and final conclusion covering the opportunities and risks involved for the Dutch sector.The Centre of Exellence (CoE) should lead to better education in maritime and logistics in Indonesia in order to keep up with future demand and developments of the industry. By having a specialised CoE in maritime and logistics, students enter the labour market with the right knowledge and skillset, thereby increasing the quality of the human resources.</narrative>
  </description>
